  "title": "增长是无关紧要的特质",
  "published_at": "2026-10-17 14:26",
  "published_at_basis": "修改于",
  "type": "article",
  "author": "黑黑无常",
  "author_id": "7342779920",
  "body_text": "没有竞争远比增长重要，定价权远比增长重要。\n\n大多数人投资失败的原因在于过度看重增长，却极端忽视竞争。\n\n竞争会侵蚀利润，行业规模并不足以弥补竞争带来的利润侵蚀。绝大多数企业的利润都来自于行业高增长阶段带来的供需错配，也即需求大于供给带来的溢价，这时候疯狂扩产、占山为王自然带来超额利润，但当供给的增长大于需求的增长时，这种供需错配的逻辑就被快速扭转，进而带来利润的快速下降甚至亏损。因此只有当行业不增长时才能看出哪些行业的企业因为其独特的商业模式或者行业的特性带来了差异化，且这种差异化阻断了竞争的可能性，进而带来了超额的利润。\n\n没有竞争带来远期利润的可预测性。这时候基于自由现金流折现为企业估值才成为可能，企业的全生命周期才有基于某个范围进行货币化估值的可能。\n\n而提价带来的利润增长远大于营收增长带来的，定价权是企业天然无风险的杠杆，而通过业务增长带来的利润依赖业务的膨胀、组织的膨胀、运营资本的膨胀，同时往往不具备规模效应，甚至总是由于阶段性的组织摩擦会导致负规模效应。而提价权带来的利润是免费的。一个利润率 10% 的生意，每提价 1%，会带来 10% 的利润增长。而通常一个企业通过扩展提升 10% 的营收，往往会带来更小幅度的利润增长。所以，定价权是好企业的隐性杠杆。\n\n投资中真正重要的事情很少，大部分事情根本无关紧要。唯一重要的是没有竞争和定价权。",
  "body_html": "<p style=\"display: none;\">来源<h-char unicode=\"ff1a\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-jiya\"><h-inner>：</h-inner></h-char>雪球App<h-char unicode=\"ff0c\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>，</h-inner></h-char>作者<h-char unicode=\"ff1a\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-jiya\"><h-inner>：</h-inner></h-char> 黑黑无常<h-char unicode=\"ff0c\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya bd-consecutive\"><h-inner>，</h-inner></h-char><h-char unicode=\"ff08\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-open bd-jiya bd-consecutive end-portion\" prev=\"bd-end bd-cop\"><h-inner>（</h-inner></h-char>https://xueqiu.com/7342779920/412690019<h-char unicode=\"ff09\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-close bd-end bd-jiya\"><h-inner>）</h-inner></h-char></p><p>没有竞争远比增长重要<h-char unicode=\"ff0c\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>，</h-inner></h-char>定价权远比增长重要<h-char unicode=\"3002\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>。</h-inner></h-char></p><p>大多数人投资失败的原因在于过度看重增长<h-char unicode=\"ff0c\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>，</h-inner></h-char>却极端忽视竞争<h-char unicode=\"3002\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>。</h-inner></h-char></p><p>竞争会侵蚀利润<h-char unicode=\"ff0c\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>，</h-inner></h-char>行业规模并不足以弥补竞争带来的利润侵蚀<h-char unicode=\"3002\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>。</h-inner></h-char>绝大多数企业的利润都来自于行业高增长阶段带来的供需错配<h-char unicode=\"ff0c\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>，</h-inner></h-char>也即需求大于供给带来的溢价<h-char unicode=\"ff0c\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>，</h-inner></h-char>这时候疯狂扩产<h-char unicode=\"3001\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>、</h-inner></h-char>占山为王自然带来超额利润<h-char unicode=\"ff0c\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>，</h-inner></h-char>但当供给的增长大于需求的增长时<h-char unicode=\"ff0c\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>，</h-inner></h-char>这种供需错配的逻辑就被快速扭转<h-char unicode=\"ff0c\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>，</h-inner></h-char>进而带来利润的快速下降甚至亏损<h-char unicode=\"3002\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>。</h-inner></h-char>因此只有当行业不增长时才能看出哪些行业的企业因为其独特的商业模式或者行业的特性带来了差异化<h-char unicode=\"ff0c\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>，</h-inner></h-char>且这种差异化阻断了竞争的可能性<h-char unicode=\"ff0c\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>，</h-inner></h-char>进而带来了超额的利润<h-char unicode=\"3002\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>。</h-inner></h-char></p><p>没有竞争带来远期利润的可预测性<h-char unicode=\"3002\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>。</h-inner></h-char>这时候基于<a href=\"https://xueqiu.com/S/SZ980092?from=status_stock_match\" class=\"xq_stock\">自由现金流</a>折现为企业估值才成为可能<h-char unicode=\"ff0c\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>，</h-inner></h-char>企业的全生命周期才有基于某个范围进行货币化估值的可能<h-char unicode=\"3002\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>。</h-inner></h-char></p><p>而提价带来的利润增长远大于营收增长带来的<h-char unicode=\"ff0c\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>，</h-inner></h-char>定价权是企业天然无风险的杠杆<h-char unicode=\"ff0c\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>，</h-inner></h-char>而通过业务增长带来的利润依赖业务的膨胀<h-char unicode=\"3001\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>、</h-inner></h-char>组织的膨胀<h-char unicode=\"3001\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>、</h-inner></h-char>运营资本的膨胀<h-char unicode=\"ff0c\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>，</h-inner></h-char>同时往往不具备规模效应<h-char unicode=\"ff0c\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>，</h-inner></h-char>甚至总是由于阶段性的组织摩擦会导致负规模效应<h-char unicode=\"3002\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>。</h-inner></h-char>而提价权带来的利润是免费的<h-char unicode=\"3002\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>。</h-inner></h-char>一个利润率 10% 的生意<h-char unicode=\"ff0c\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>，</h-inner></h-char>每提价 1%<h-char unicode=\"ff0c\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>，</h-inner></h-char>会带来 10% 的利润增长<h-char unicode=\"3002\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>。</h-inner></h-char>而通常一个企业通过扩展提升 10% 的营收<h-char unicode=\"ff0c\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>，</h-inner></h-char>往往会带来更小幅度的利润增长<h-char unicode=\"3002\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>。</h-inner></h-char>所以<h-char unicode=\"ff0c\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>，</h-inner></h-char>定价权是好企业的隐性杠杆<h-char unicode=\"3002\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>。</h-inner></h-char></p><p>投资中真正重要的事情很少<h-char unicode=\"ff0c\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>，</h-inner></h-char>大部分事情根本无关紧要<h-char unicode=\"3002\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>。</h-inner></h-char>唯一重要的是没有竞争和定价权<h-char unicode=\"3002\" class=\"biaodian cjk bd-end bd-cop bd-hangable bd-jiya\"><h-inner>。</h-inner></h-char></p>",
